## Combining commands 
&    refers to starting the command in the background so that the terminal cant do something else it s use is eg.  mkdir project &
&&   if and only if logic  eg mkdir project && cd project && touch main.cpp
>    Can be used to save output eg echo "example" > eg but it overites exesiting content 
>>   Can be used to save output without overwiting it appends 

